<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SOCCER-COLLATED RESULTS OF AFRICAN CUP TIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-COLLATED RESULTS OF AFRICAN CUP TIES.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Collated results of African club competition semifinal, first leg ties played at the weekend:</p>
<p>African Champions Cup:</p>
<p>JS Kabylie (Algeria) 1 Shooting Stars (Nigeria) 1</p>
<p>CS Sfaxien (Tunisia) 1 Zamalek (Egypt) 0</p>
<p>African Cup Winners' Cup:</p>
<p>CR Belouizdad (Algeria) 1 Sodigraf (Zaire) 1</p>
<p>Arab Contractors (Egypt) 2 Canon Yaounde (Cameroon) 1</p>
<p>Confederation of African Football (CAF) Cup:</p>
<p>Etoile Sahel (Tunisia) 2 Vita Club (Zaire) 0</p>
<p>Kawkab Marrakesh (Morocco) 4 Kenya Breweries (Kenya) 1</p>
<p>The second leg matches will be played during the weekend of October 25-27.</p>
</text>
